msgstr "通訊端連線與讀寫逾時時間（秒）。"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Redis Secret Reference"
msgstr "Redis 機密參照"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Typed secret reference (env:VAR or vault:plugin:slot); raw passwords are never stored."
msgstr "具型別的機密參照（env:VAR 或 vault:plugin:slot）；絕不儲存明文密碼。"

